            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will have compassion on Jacob and will again choose Israel, and will set them in their own land, and aliens will join them and will cleave to the house of Jacob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
